+ entry .Northwest   o ponto colateral noroeste, 315°: `IntercardinalWind.Northwest`, exportado
+ entry .NorthNortheast   o ponto subcolateral nor-nordeste, 22,5°: `HalfWind.NorthNortheast`, exportado
+ entry .EastNortheast   o ponto subcolateral lés-nordeste, 67,5°: `HalfWind.EastNortheast`, exportado
+ entry .EastSoutheast   o ponto subcolateral lés-sudeste, 112,5°: `HalfWind.EastSoutheast`, exportado
